# OpenClaw maestro-flow-review-agent: daily scheduled Maestro flow review.
# Cron is UTC; runs at 06:00 UTC daily. The wrapper enforces the 12h
# manual-run suppression gate and posts one message per tick (heartbeat
# model): findings, "✓ ran — 0 findings", or "⏸ suppressed". A missing
# message at ~06:05 UTC therefore means the cron or host failed.
#
# Deployed to: /etc/cron.d/openclaw-maestro-review (root:root, mode 644).
0 6 * * * openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/maestro-review-cron.sh
